    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FAST, FREQUENT SERVICE\nDAS,\naIRLInES\nEXPANDING IN THE PACIFIC WEST\nWASHINGTON, OREGON AND IDAHO\nAND NOW CALIFORNIA!\nWEST COAST AIRLINES\nYour new key to the Golden Gate!\nEFFECTIVE JULY 31, 1959",
      "WASHINGTON\nPORT\nANGELES\nOMAK\nSEATTLE\nSPOKANE\nABERDEEN\nHOQUIAM\nASTORIA\n(SEASIDE)\nNEWPORT O\nTOLEDO\nNORTH BEND O\nCOOS BAY\nWENATCHEE\n• COEUR d'ALENE\nOLYMPIA O\nEPHRATA\nMOSES LAKE\nYAKIMA\nPULLMAN\nO moscOw\nWALLA\nWALLA\nPASCO\nRICHLAND\nKENNEWICK\nO LEWISTON\nCLARKSTON\nPORTLAND\nVANCOUVER\n-PENDLETON O\nLA GRANDE O\nO SALEM\nBAKER O\nALBANY\nCORVALLIS\nEUGENE\nOREGON\nONTARIO O\nPAYETTE\nBEND\nO REDMOND\nROSEBURG\nBURNS\nMEDFORD O\nKLAMATH\nFALLS\nO LAKEVIEW\nKALISPELL\nCUT BANK\nSHELBY\nGREAT FALLS\nMONTANA\nCALIFORNIA\nWCA\nSACRAMENTO\nOAKLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO\n• MCCALL (SEASONAL)\nIDAHO\nBOISE\nSUN VALLEY\n• HAILEY\nKETCHUM\nIDAHO FALLS\n• POCATELLO\nTWIN FALLS O\nBURLEY\nRUPERT\nOLOGAN\nO OGDEN\nO SALT LAKE CITY\nUTAH\nNOTE: Service to Salt Lake City, Logan and Ogden to\nstart September 1, 1959.\nService to Omak, Lakeview, Burns, Sun Valley-Hailey-\nKetchum to be inaugurated\nas soon as facilities are\navailable.\nService to Kalispell, Cut Bank-Shelby, Great Falls tenta-\ntively approved by Civil Aeronautics Board and now\nawaiting final decision."
    ],
